<Doc title="Disclaimer: Not Investment Advice, Data Accuracy and Timing" description="Macro Release Desk reports official statistics for information only. It is not investment advice; figures may be revised and release times can change." path="/disclaimer/" h1="Disclaimer" kicker="Legal · disclaimer" updated="2026-10-15"
  answer="Macro Release Desk is an information service that reproduces and explains official economic statistics. It is not investment, trading, tax or legal advice, and it does not predict data or markets.">
  <h2>Not financial advice</h2>
  <p>Economic data can move markets sharply. Nothing here recommends any trade or investment. Consult a licensed adviser before making financial decisions.</p>
  <h2>Accuracy and timing</h2>
  <p>Our pages are static snapshots refreshed on a schedule, not a live feed. On release days the official figure appears on the agency site first; our page updates only after the next refresh. Preliminary figures are revised, and agencies sometimes reschedule releases.</p>
  <h2>Computed figures</h2>
  <p>Annualised rates, spreads, averages and rule-of-thumb readings (such as the Sahm-style gap) are our calculations from published data and are labelled as such. They are descriptive, not forecasts. See the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</p>
  <h2>No affiliation</h2>
  <p>We are not affiliated with or endorsed by any statistical agency or central bank mentioned on this site. Questions go to the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
